licence of the repository they were published in (a RoboTwin fork affiliated with the vendor). Before any public
release of RoboOlympics with this robot, written confirmation from Guangdong TianJi Intelligent Systems (天机智能)
that these assets may be redistributed under this licence is required.

The Tianji Marvin Pro model (model.xml, meshes/) is derived from the URDF and STL meshes of
KLMmotion/marvin_pro_robotwin, assets/embodiments/tianji (commit 1e30f003984ddb82d2994474b015f0933c131d94,
https://github.com/KLMmotion/marvin_pro_robotwin), published under the repository's MIT licence reproduced below.
The changes are listed in tools/make_model.py.

